{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a hotel room. Find the anomaly and break free from the loop.<br><br><strong>Find anomalies. </strong><br> <br><strong>Fix anomalies. </strong><br> <br><strong>Get out from the Loop.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664140/extras/Steam_Banner__480_x_100_px_.gif?t=1744977622\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Room Stalker is a short walking simulator inspired by The Exit 8, Luxury Dark, and I'm on Obeservation Duty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is available in English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese and Indonesian.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">~20 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Fix Anomaly\u3011<br>\u00a0 You can point to the anomaly to fix the anomaly. <br><br>\u3010Object Inspector\u3011<br>\u00a0 Observe objects to find out the background about this place. <br><br>\u3010Loop\u3011<br>\u00a0 The further you walk, the more scary and dangerous the loop becomes.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Five Anomalies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664140/979595f2ee43ee79e87a9ec34693468707c142b4.jpg"},{"name":"Ten Anomalies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664140/5f6cd427cd46c5c89d9aab75c3c993027291bbec.jpg"},{"name":"Fifteen Anomalies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664140/aa69e173f3375bed3fbc2d105904146fdc616edc.jpg"},{"name":"Anomalies Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3664140/319363a270723f0595053b3d632fe08b5de5bd22.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3664140?t=1744977622","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima